#: style.css
msgid "A minimal, accessible WordPress FSE starter theme, and the shared foundation for a growing collection of niche editorial and small-business themes. Use it as-is for a clean, accessible start, or build on the CORE/SKIN architecture to make your own themed version without touching the portable core files."
