#, php-format
msgid "%s is a free, full-site-editing theme built to get out of the way of your content. Here is how to make it yours."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin.php:241
msgid "Choose what people land on."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin.php:242
msgid "A visitor's first second decides whether they stay. Set a static front page under Settings → Reading, and give your posts a page of their own."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin.php:245
msgid "Give people a way around."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin.php:246
msgid "A site without a menu is a room without doors. Open the Site Editor, edit the header, click the Navigation block, and add your pages or an existing menu to it."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin.php:249
msgid "Start from a pattern, not a blank page."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin.php:250
msgid "In any page or post, open the block inserter, choose Patterns, and find this theme's group. Drop one in and change the words."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin.php:253
msgid "Make it sound like you."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin.php:254
msgid "In the Site Editor, open Styles to change colours and typefaces. Nothing you do there can break the theme, so experiment freely."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin.php:258
msgid "This theme is fast by design: no front-end JavaScript framework, no third-party requests, and tuning against the Core Web Vitals search engines actually measure."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin.php:259
msgid "It is built with WCAG 2.2 AA in mind: real focus outlines, a skip link, sensible heading order, and motion that respects a reduce-motion setting. Keep your own copy and images to that bar and the whole site stays welcoming."
msgstr ""

